RESEARCH USE NOTICE
-------------------
This software is developed as a defensive digital-forensics research framework
for controlled laboratory experiments. It is not intended for offensive use,
real-world deployment, or operation against systems outside an authorized
isolated laboratory environment. See docs/methodology.md and the project
dissertation for the intended scope of use.
